<!--
  The stock and compliance register.

  A clipboard with ruled lines — the object an inspection arrives carrying,
  and the one a shopkeeper recognises before reading the label under it. It
  replaces @android:drawable/ic_menu_agenda, an Android 1.x system glyph that
  was drawn for a 2008 phone and looked it: fussy at 24dp, a different weight
  from every other icon in this app, and on the screen that is supposed to
  say "your shop keeps proper records" it said the opposite.

  Drawn on the same 24dp grid and as a single filled path, like the rest of
  the set, so it takes its colour from the tint it is given.
-->
